# Unicode CLDR 47, locale eo, gregorian wide (format/stand-alone identical)
# and abbreviated month names (cldr-dates-full/main/eo/ca-gregorian.json).
# The accusative -n form ("junion") is a regular temporal accusative
# (en.wiktionary.org "-n"), added alongside the nominative because unlike
# WEEKDAY, MONTH carries no nominative/accusative recurrence split -- both
# forms name the same month with the same reading.
junio
junion
jun
